wclip - wayland clipboard manager
=================================
wclip is a small tool for managing your Wayland selections.


Requirements
------------
wclip uses the ext-data-control-v1 Wayland extension in addition to the base
wayland-client library.
Libmagic is also required for MIME detection.


Installation
------------
Edit config.mk to match your preferences (especially where you have the
wayland-protocols installed). Then installation is as simple as:

$ make
# make install


Usage
-----
See the man page.

Configuration
-------------
Edit config.h and (re)compile.
